<title>USA: Coca-Cola signs deal to link drinks with NHL.</title>
<headline>Coca-Cola signs deal to link drinks with NHL.</headline>
<dateline>ATLANTA 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Coca-Cola Co said Tuesday it signed a deal with the National Hockey League which links Coca-Cola classic, POWERaDE and Surge to the sport.</p>
<p>The company said the agreement reflects a renewed corporate commitment to hockey, with increased investment in advertising, marketing and grassroots programs.  </p>
<p>The company called the sponsorship a strategic alliance with a grassroots focus that capitalizes on the growth in hockey popularity among teen males.</p>
</text>
